  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN226.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">talaimakaṟkut tōḻi vāyiṉmaṟuttatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">How the confidante refused the door to HIM.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN226.1">
        <l>uṇarkuve ṉalle ṉuraiyaniṉ māya</l>
        <l>nāṇilai maṉṟa yāṇa rūra</l>
        <l>vakalu ḷāṅka ṇa<supplied>m</supplied>pakai maṭivaik</l>
        <l>kuṟuntoṭi makaḷir kurūuppuṉaṉ muṉaiyiṟ</l>
        <l>paḻaṉap paiñcāy koḻutiṉak kaḻaṉik</l>
        <l>karantaiyañ ceṟuviṉ veṇkuru kōppum</l>
        <l><supplied>val</supplied>vil leṟuḻttōṭ paratavar <supplied>kōmā</supplied>ṉ</l>
        <l>palvēṉ matti kaḻāar muṉṟuṟai</l>
        <l>neṭuveṇ marutoṭu vañci cāay</l>
        <l>viṭiyal vanta perunī<supplied>r</supplied>k kāvirit</l>
        <l>toṭiyaṇi muṉkai nīvey yōḷoṭu</l>
        <l>muṉṉā ḷāṭiya kavvai yinnāḷ</l>
        <l>valimiku muṉpiṟ pāṇaṉoṭu malitārt</l>
        <l>tittaṉ veḷiya ṉuṟuntai nāḷavaip</l>
        <l>pāṭiṉ ṟeṇkiṇaip pāṭukēṭ ṭañcip</l>
        <l>pēraṭu tāṉaik kaṭṭi</l>
        <l>pēraṭu tāṉaiya vārppiṉum peritē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1">I don’t understand your wordy magic,</l>
        <l corresp="2">you have no shame, man from the fertile village.</l>
        <l corresp="8">On the front ghat of Kaḻāar [belonging to] Matti with many spears,</l>
        <l corresp="7">king of fishermen with strong bows [and] mighty shoulders,</l>
        <l>where, in that place with wide interior, women with small bracelets</l>
        <l>[and] pretty contrasting foliage scare away from the thistle fields</l>
        <l>by the paddy fields white herons that peck at</l>
        <l corresp="3-6">the Paiñcāy grass by the tank when they shun the sparkling flood,</l>
        <l corresp="12a-c">the scandal that [you] bathed yesterday</l>
        <l corresp="11">with one whom you are keen, [her] forearms adorned with bracelets,</l>
        <l corresp="10">in the Kāviri with great water that came at dawn,</l>
        <l corresp="9">having bent down the Mahuas along with the tall white Myrobalan trees,</l>
        <l corresp="12d+17">today is greater than the noises related to the huge murderous army</l>
        <l corresp="16">of Kaṭṭi with a huge murderous army,</l>
        <l corresp="15">afraid when hearing the sound of the sleepless Kiṇai drum</l>
        <l corresp="14">in the assembly by day in Uṟuntai of Tittaṉ Veḷiyaṉ</l>
        <l corresp="13">amply garlanded, with a bard of a strength surpassing strength.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

